{"job_id":"F-a368f60665c55435194d","family_id":"F-a368f60665c55435194d","title":"국군수송사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"723b8ec7d61b867d14ad01309d67d34a1cb4b6ddc1964fd30a23dfc2fb7dd994","source_hash":"0ff54970aec66307bdd60b711542b0303e5154f394c7fe2f92a7ed3643789cef","text":"韩国武装部队运输司令部命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":81,"target_id":"88767b429a62378d5dca896725ada3cb6070cf4d5b864be42ad74da1059f8ccd","source_hash":"912b92789d40424d39e683af6233a22f8d510fb9e02a46768c0e89a2202d9eac","text":"第一条（设立）在国防部长领导下设立武装部队运输司令部，负责监督军队运输保障事务，并为执行联合作战和联合行动提供必要的运输保障。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":81,"end":447,"target_id":"70a68b33c97af02c926989b48b0b9af62bad704aabe194fbc62c19670ade08a6","source_hash":"0313a1fd938cd36bb06ea24ffcbeb2801e9800956ad305883c6c8fec2670eb4a","text":"第二条（任务）武装部队运输司令部（以下简称“司令部”）应执行下列各款规定的任务。<2010年3月23日修订>\n1. 与军队铁路和公路运输相关的职责\n2. 负责为陆军和空军提供海上运输支援和空中运输支援（与相关军种合作提供支持）\n3. 关于战时运输计划的工作\n4. 与军事战略运输支援相关的职责，例如协调和控制战时动员的民用船舶和飞机的运行。\n5. 负责通过铁路和公路管理军事运输以及支援护送任务\n6. 通过港口和海岸开展登陆后勤作业的职责（与相关军事部门合作提供支持）\n7. 负责军事物资和装备的空运（与相关军事部门合作提供支持）\n8. 联合运输机动司令部的建立和运作\n9. 海外部署运输支援职责\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":447,"end":536,"target_id":"17281055107d36540f3df7d3591acbd417465037b20f056feb98844ed8b31958","source_hash":"40a60a366e86eb0a69efb2fa413483e6202598bdf3472bc35bf067e1266b82a5","text":"第三条（司令员等的任命）司令部设一名司令员和一名参谋长；司令员由将军担任，参谋长由野战军官担任。<2017年9月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":536,"end":689,"target_id":"ca8bf12eb11c5d42351e881ad848b259aa6afa7182d7ea53c2d5597a5cc547b7","source_hash":"d0eaf6e30c3277104322be87cb1d3d04a11e062b1c2a133b9bee14bceaab2810","text":"第四条（指挥官等的职责）\n① 司令官奉参谋长联席会议主席之命，负责监督司令部的整体运作，并指挥和监督隶属于或分配给司令部的各单位。<2010年3月23日修订>\n参谋长协助指挥官，并在指挥官因不可避免的情况无法履行职责时代表指挥官行事。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":689,"end":848,"target_id":"45f3fd13ed70d4d0e6b7164a7f2da9d2aa8212b72bb6ce73887c21aee15f7ef5","source_hash":"69e175abcb6b0293071d0c9c1592dba140d986ab9e3825a686cc3edfa26abaca","text":"第五条（部门和单位的设立）\n① 司令部内设立参谋部门，协助司令履行职责，各单位置于司令的管辖之下。\n② 根据第1款，有关参谋部门的设立和职责划分的事项，由参谋长联席会议主席决定；有关司令部下属单位的设立、任务和组织事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":848,"end":893,"target_id":"bcb7fa2a4dbce8a7305eb8d8de877fb4716970c1e0c90edd8bdeb77761936d52","source_hash":"dd54e0cca88be4d2e3ea25c3f625632f8fc0490888828191ea8621b1bc6b2e51","text":"第六条（人员配额） 指挥部应配备军事人员和文职人员，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":893,"end":913,"target_id":"da2149b2c0e7d9a4d6c35e5dd9f5ce63222b51cb1f1624975860ce63dcf108e0","source_hash":"f9c817ce57d303526b6c833e62217274d92957a15117b08a170780523315ac0f","text":"删除条款 7 <2010.3.23>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":913,"end":963,"target_id":"a07fbe415d19929b73a8d4a1869398551c3f516f89e44a62a716fa04ebe4b6cc","source_hash":"d1b295d00993af36d24bb8aee23c168f461a4eacf84ef342b3b489d726896058","text":"补充规定 <第16140号，1999年2月27日>\n\n本法令自1999年3月2日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":963,"end":1008,"target_id":"9a6e8e02fb7df475f07dfd41d92dff4f8684cde764fa22c687f411a08cdcb05d","source_hash":"e5481039b96e35592d34566c012ad32ee154466fdd24277a658e5ef70e548c3c","text":"补充规定 <第17787号，2002年11月29日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1008,"end":1052,"target_id":"958f13b2319bbb7fe23ed8858639f61c30f98cbe8f8c7e44cde2941a83988a21","source_hash":"96c3279b83ba855a6af79e56c3ef4d025ee0e3ab410dcd3b9f70bc206af44ad5","text":"补充规定 <第22078号，2010年3月23日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1052,"end":1085,"target_id":"364ba40b171280ef60280964a1b4f18e3a7fdcdc7c38a5f034b54bd7800fdd39","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1085,"end":1122,"target_id":"1598e0132de4eb39593b311894d54ce92cc2ee2c0e9eb112670c9464cdf29543","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1122,"end":1136,"target_id":"533ccee3d8071173f6106fc25a58743cc95a5c222cb3850d215afbaac5628de2","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1136,"end":1194,"target_id":"413af4d0e2a7e772647cb8cf75fa7b5fe01e3d5b0c8081d886e195fd7139f625","source_hash":"40a46a80b8d6bd81843772fc1cd1451c65999bc7efcf1779a257c2eeb3c403df","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至⑭ 已省略\n\n  ⑮ 武装部队运输司令部命令的部分内容修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002693-197234-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1194,"end":1245,"target_id":"b97c7035e14e4dc0fe8e2f90766c6fb1e33015f40b5188aa01133c44f3e6a49f","source_hash":"8dffe92913918d2f7a1c3738139dc5a1a3fc5509d26c781d6e2c5ef24bdcee23","text":"  第3条中的“部长级”应改为“将军级”。\n\n  <16> 至 <90> 已省略"}]}